 1. INTRODUCTION

1.1 Purpose of the Project

SUVASAM FOODS is an edible oil company that wants to promote its products and reach more customers through an online platform.

The main purpose of this project is to develop a professional and user-friendly website for the company. Through this website, customers can learn about the company, explore different edible oil products, view product details and place orders.

Nowadays, many customers search for products through Google before purchasing them. Therefore, this website will also be designed to improve the company's online visibility through proper Search Engine Optimization (SEO).

The website will help SUVASAM FOODS build its online presence, attract new customers and make product ordering easier.

 1.2 Scope of the Project

The SUVASAM FOODS website will provide complete information about the company and its edible oil products.

Customers can visit the website, learn about the company's background, explore available products and check their details.

The website will include an ordering facility through which customers can submit their product requirements. They can also contact the company through WhatsApp or phone calls for further information.

The website will be designed to work on computers, tablets and mobile phones.

The major scope of this project includes:

- Promoting the SUVASAM FOODS brand online.
- Displaying all available edible oil products.
- Providing product descriptions and images.
- Allowing customers to place product orders.
- Providing WhatsApp and phone contact options.
- Improving the company's visibility on Google through SEO.
- Providing an easy way for customers to communicate with the company.

1.3 Objectives of the Project

The main objectives of developing this website are:

1. To create a professional online presence for SUVASAM FOODS.
2. To advertise the company's edible oil products.
3. To provide complete product information to customers.
4. To make product ordering easier through the website.
5. To increase customer enquiries and business opportunities.
6. To make the website easily accessible on mobile phones and computers.
7. To improve the website's position in Google search results through SEO techniques.
8. To build customer trust by displaying company information and product details.

 1.4 Existing System

Currently, customers may depend on direct communication, physical shops or other traditional methods to know about the company's products.

These methods may not provide complete product information to customers who are searching online.

Some limitations of the existing system are:

- Limited online visibility.
- Customers may not know all the available products.
- Product information is not available in one place.
- Customers need to contact the company directly for enquiries.
- Advertising through traditional methods may reach only a limited number of people.

 1.5 Proposed System

The proposed system is a website developed for SUVASAM FOODS to promote its edible oil products and provide an easy ordering facility.

The website will display company information, product images, product descriptions and contact details.

Customers can browse products, select the products they need and submit their order enquiries through an online order form or WhatsApp.

The website will also follow SEO practices to help search engines understand its content and improve its chances of appearing in relevant Google search results.

