 2. SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS

2.1 Hardware Requirements

The following hardware is required to develop and access the website.

- Computer or Laptop
- Minimum 4 GB RAM
- Internet Connection
- Standard Keyboard and Mouse
- Smartphone for mobile testing

 2.2 Software Requirements

- Operating System: Windows 10 / Windows 11
- Development Tool: Google Antigravity
- Web Browser: Google Chrome
- Frontend: HTML, CSS and JavaScript or suitable modern web technologies
- Database / Backend: To be decided based on the final implementation requirements
- Internet Connection for development and testing


 3. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

Functional requirements describe the main features that the website should provide to customers.

 3.1 Home Page

The home page will be the first page customers see when they visit the website.

It will contain:

- SUVASAM FOODS company logo.
- Attractive banner images.
- Welcome message.
- Short introduction about the company.
- Featured edible oil products.
- Highlights of the company's products.
- Contact and order buttons.

 3.2 About Us Page

This page will provide information about SUVASAM FOODS.

It will include:

- Company introduction.
- Company background.
- Business activities.
- Company vision and mission.
- Information about product quality.

 3.3 Products Page

This page will display all edible oil products available from the company.

The products may include:

1. Groundnut Oil – கடலை எண்ணெய்
2. Gingelly Oil – நல்லெண்ணெய்
3. Coconut Oil – தேங்காய் எண்ணெய்
4. Neem Oil – வேப்பெண்ணெய்
5. Castor Oil – விளக்கெண்ணெய்

Each product will display:

- Product name.
- Product image.
- Product description.
- Available quantity or packaging options.
- Price, if provided by the company.
- Order Now button.

3.4 Product Details Page

When customers select a particular product, they can view more information about it.

This page will display the product name, images, description, available packaging sizes and other details provided by the company.

 3.5 Online Order Facility

Customers can place product order requests through the website.

The order form will collect the following information:

- Customer name.
- Mobile number.
- Email address (optional).
- Delivery address.
- Product name.
- Required quantity.
- Additional message.

After submitting the form, customers should receive an appropriate confirmation message or instructions for further communication.

 3.6 WhatsApp Enquiry

Customers can directly contact the company through WhatsApp.

When a customer clicks the WhatsApp button, it will open a WhatsApp conversation with the company's official contact number.

This will make product enquiries and order communication easier.

3.7 Contact Us Page

The contact page will provide all necessary communication details.

It will include:

- Company phone number.
- WhatsApp number.
- Email address.
- Business address.
- Google Maps location, if available.
- Contact enquiry form.

 3.8 Search Engine Optimization (SEO)

SEO is an important feature of this project.

The website will be designed in a way that helps Google and other search engines understand its content.

The following SEO techniques will be included:

- Proper page titles and descriptions.
- Relevant keywords related to edible oils.
- SEO-friendly website URLs.
- Proper image names and alternative text.
- Mobile-friendly design.
- Fast-loading pages.
- Sitemap and robots.txt configuration.
- Google Search Console integration.
- Relevant and useful website content.

The aim is to improve the website's visibility when customers search for SUVASAM FOODS and its edible oil products.

 3.9 Mobile-Friendly Design

The website will automatically adjust to different screen sizes.

Customers should be able to browse products, read information and place order requests using mobile phones, tablets and computers.



4. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

Non-functional requirements describe how the website should perform.

 4.1 User-Friendly Interface

The website should have a simple and attractive design. Customers should be able to find products and contact information without difficulty.

 4.2 Performance

The website should load quickly and display images and content without unnecessary delays.

 4.3 Security

Customer information submitted through the website should be handled safely. Contact forms and order details should be protected from unauthorized access.

 4.4 Reliability

The website should work properly and provide correct information whenever customers access it.

 4.5 Compatibility

The website should support commonly used browsers such as Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge and Firefox.

 4.6 Responsiveness

The website should adjust properly to mobile phones, tablets, laptops and desktop computers.

 4.7 Maintainability

The website should be easy to update when the company introduces new products, changes prices or modifies its contact details.



 5. MAJOR MODULES OF THE PROJECT

The website will be divided into the following major modules:

5.1 Home Module
Displays the company introduction, banners, featured products and important website information.

 5.2 About Module
Provides information about the company, its background, vision and mission.

5.3 Product Module
Displays the available edible oil products with images, names and descriptions.

 5.4 Order Module
Allows customers to select products, enter their details and submit order requests.

 5.5 Contact Module
Provides phone, WhatsApp, email and address information.

 5.6 SEO Module
Helps improve the website's visibility in search engines through SEO-friendly content and technical settings.

 5.7 Customer Enquiry Module
Allows customers to send questions and receive further information about products.



 6. USE CASE DESCRIPTION

The main user of this website is the customer.

The customer can perform the following activities:

1. Open the SUVASAM FOODS website.
2. View the home page.
3. Read about the company.
4. Browse the available edible oil products.
5. Select a product.
6. View product information.
7. Submit an order request.
8. Contact the company through WhatsApp or phone.
9. Send enquiries through the contact form.

The company representative can receive the enquiries and order requests and communicate with customers to confirm their orders.



 7. SYSTEM WORKFLOW

The basic working process of the website is as follows:

1. The customer visits the SUVASAM FOODS website.
2. The home page displays the company and its products.
3. The customer visits the products section.
4. The customer selects the required edible oil.
5. The customer views product details.
6. The customer clicks the Order Now button.
7. The customer enters the required details in the order form.
8. The customer submits the order request.
9. The company receives the order enquiry.
10. The company contacts the customer to confirm the order and delivery details.


